---
title: How to duplicate a quotation
sidebar:
  order: 8
---
**To duplicate a quotation:**

1. **Go to “Quotations” Section:**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on “Quotations” to view the list of quotations.**

1. **Select the Quotation to Duplicate:**

   - **Find the quotation you wish to duplicate from the list.**
   - **Click the ellipsis menu (…) next to the quotation.**

1. **Duplicate the Quotation:**

   - **In the dropdown menu, click on “Duplicate Quotation”.**
   - **A duplicate of the selected quotation will be created, and you can then edit or send the duplicated quotation as needed.**

**Alternatively, you can also access the “Duplicate Quotation” option within the quotation details page under the “Save Quotation” dropdown.**
